# AI Build Kit check-up dates. UTC, written as YYYY-MM-DD. start writes founded,
# and a founding-menu line naming the recipes on the menu it showed; maintain
# writes the two pass lines, and a recipe-move-declined line when the person
# turns down a move onto a recipe. Any command writes a check-myself|yes line
# when the person asks to try every piece before it is saved, and takes it out
# when they ask to stop; section-builder reads it. setup-ai-build-kit writes a
# worktree-links line naming the ignored files a run's worktrees link, as
# `worktree-links|<path> ; <path>`, and a confidential line naming the
# confidential folder, as `confidential|<folder>`; the implement skill's
# worktree script reads both. maintain writes a worktree-links line too, or a
# worktree-links-declined line when the person turns the links down, and a
# project-check-declined line when the person turns down recording the
# project's own CI as its project check. Nothing else edits this file.
